{
  "name": "Create contract review packs with redline comparisons using Cloud Office Print",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Contract review pack\n\nWhen a counterparty sends back a revised contract, upload both versions and get one PDF for the approvers: a cover sheet with the deal contact and sign-off boxes, followed by a comparison of the two versions.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Start a contract review** takes both PDFs, the counterparty's email and a due date.\n2. Cloud Office Print compares the versions and stamps the result FOR INTERNAL REVIEW.\n3. The counterparty is looked up in the CRM by email.\n4. A DOCX cover sheet is filled and turned into a PDF.\n5. Cover and comparison are merged into one review pack and saved to Google Drive.\n\n### Setup steps\n1. Install the `n8n-nodes-cloudofficeprint` community node.\n2. Add your Cloud Office Print credential to the four Cloud Office Print nodes.\n3. Point **Look up counterparty in CRM** at your CRM.\n4. Connect Google Drive, see the note under the workflow.\n\nTo try it, upload `consulting-agreement-v1.pdf` and `-v2.pdf` from the Google Drive and Counterparty  Email (emily.johnson@x.dummyjson.com)",
        "height": 880,
        "width": 388
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -32,
        112
      ],
      "id": "1580228f-fd89-41d7-b166-928488af39fa",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Compare the versions\nThe comparison is kept as Base64, because the CRM call that follows replaces the item's files.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        416,
        208
      ],
      "id": "478f1c04-4515-49e5-a5c8-bb3198dc6f50",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Compare the versions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Build the review pack\nThe first file in **Merge review pack** is the cover sheet, the second is the stamped comparison.\n\n**Download cover template** gets the template from Google Drive. Pick your own copy there.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 1480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        208
      ],
      "id": "9609c631-5386-432a-ada4-a9357e3e1f42",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Build the review pack"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Google Drive setup\n1. In n8n, create a **Google Drive OAuth2 API** credential. On n8n Cloud, just sign in with Google.\n2. Self-hosted: in Google Cloud, enable the Google Drive API, create an OAuth client ID and add the **OAuth Redirect URL** shown in n8n. Paste the client ID and secret into the credential and sign in.\n3. Select the credential on **Upload to Google Drive** and pick a folder.",
        "height": 456,
        "width": 264,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2640,
        96
      ],
      "id": "fd74fa80-c812-4ed2-b621-0d5199e3662d",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Google Drive setup"
    },
    {
